            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 10.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aanyita nanu maaing'oru lelo apa leitu aaikilikuanu nanu, aanyita nanu maanoto lelo apa leitu aaing'oru nanu, atejo nanu, “Nele nanu, nele nanu,” teilo osho apa leitu eipot enkarna ai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Irm 10.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aitorioko nanu nkaik aainei endama pooki aipotu olorere kiserut, lelo oopuo te nkoitoi nemesidai, esujaa mbaa enye maate; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iltung'ana laaitagor ninche oas mbususi anaake te dukuya nkonyek aainei, epolosisho ti atua nkurman neinok enkorropil te shumata isoito; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilootoni ninche too nkuraren, netoni te nkewarie too lnukat lenye; lelo ooinos nkiri oo lbitiro, ore motori o lminong netii iltooi lenye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nejo ninche, “Talamari minyiku, mikinyikaki nanu, amu aaiteng'elaki nanu aaitalam iyie.” Empuruo naimu nkumeishin aainei ena, enkima nayupuyup endama pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, eigeroki te dukuya nanu aajo, “Magira nanu, kake kaitalaku nanu, ee, kaitalaku nanu too lgooitie lenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te nena kitarruorot enye o too nkitarruorot oo loo menye te nebo, Olaitoriani ojo; enkaraki apa natapejo ninche enkorropil too nchumat oo ndoinyo, naasukeny ninche nanu te nchumata oo ldoinyo, katemaki nanu ilgooitie lenye elaakinoto oo nkitarruorotenye e apa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani: “Ore anaa enatiu enaisho oo sabibu te nkimarrimarrati nejo ninche, Minyal ninye, amu etii emayianata atua ninye, neijia alo aas te nkaraki osinka lai, nemaidaikie ninche pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayau nanu ina ishoi e Yakobo, o ene Yuda, lelo ajung'ok lo ldoinyo lai; lelo gelunot laainei oopuo aajung ine, nepuo lelo sinkan laainei aabik te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 7.24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kelo Sharon aaku endaata oo nkerra, ore Oerata le Akor neaku ewueji neirragie nchoo, e lelo tung'ana laainei laaing'oru nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore intae iloany Olaitoriani, lelo lemedamu oldoinyo lai sinyati, lelo ooirragie emesa oo mbaa oo nkitumusumusot, nimputuputu nkikompeni e naisho naitushula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karewaki nanu intae olalem, nipuopuo intae pooki aairrugokino ilo oar intae entuata; amu ore apa pee aipotisho, neitu irukishosho, ore pee airo, neitu ining'ining'i, kake itaasa intae ina torrono too nkonyek aainei, nitegelutua ina nemaaitiship.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina nji ejo Olaitoriani Enkai, “Ng'ura, kepuo isinkan laainei aadaa, kake ilo iyie aisumashu; ng'ura, kepuo isinkan laainei aaokisho, kake ketir intae enkure; ng'ura, kepuo isinkan laainei aang'idayu, kake kepuoi aaitukurru intae; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ura, kepuo isinkan laainei aaranyisho te ng'ida o ltau, kake ipuopuo intae aaishir te mion o ltau, niyietutu aaishir te nkaraki emion o ltau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning'ueikiki intae enkarna inyi lelo gelunot laainei meitaa oldeket, naa kear intae Olaitoriani Enkai entuata; kake ore lelo sinkan lenyena naa keipot ninye ti ae arna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku ore ilo omayian kewan tena kop, nemayian kewan te Nkai e sipata, ore ilo oinos olmumai te nkop, neinos te Nkai e dede; amu meekure edamuni inyamalitin e apa, neisudoyioki ninche too nkonyek aainei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
