        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.66.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 66.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 3.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 21.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Amu ng'ura, kaitobiru nanu oloing'ang'e ng'ejuk o enkop ng'ejuk; nemeitokini aadamu ntokitin e apa musan, nemeitoki aajing ilukuny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tishipayu ning'idayu ntarasi te nkaraki ina naitobiru; amu ng'ura, kaitobiru nanu Yerusalem natii eng'ida, ore lelo tung'ana lenyena neiput enchipai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.21.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 21.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kang'idakino nanu Yerusalem, nashipakino iltung'ana laainei; meigili ae kata aaning ti atua ninye oltoilo le nkishirata, anaa olkiyioi lo sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meigil ae kata nkera kutiti aaye ti atua ninye, nemeitokini aata iltung'ana kituaak lemebikoo, amu keaku keye enkerai etaa enoo larin iip, ore olaing'okoni loo larin iip netum oldeket. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku keshet ninche nkajijik nemany ninche; neun ilkeek loo lng'anayio neinos ilng'anayio lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meigil ninche aashetisho nepuonu kulikae aamany; nemeigil ninche aaunisho nepuonu ilkulikae aainos; amu ketiu nkolong'i oo ltung'ana laainei anaa nkolong'i o lchani, naa kepuo lelo gelunot laainei aashipakino te nkata naado ina siai oo nkaik enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mepuo ninche aanauru pesho anaa eiu nkera to sina; amu keaku ninche eishoi e ilo omayiana to Laitoriani, o nkera enye te nebo ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eton eitu eipotisho ninche nawaliki nanu ninche, ore eton eirorita ninche naning nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
